    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it’s not just the noise though. it’s like... there's no place for someone like me anymore. everything feels so pointless. like i'm just watching a movie that ended a long time ago and i'm the only one still sitting in the theater. why should i keep trying to find a way back into a world that's already forgotten i exist?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
